                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, loza usoo kuriko na Aamoni na ulavye unabii chinyume chao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aambire, ‘Phundzani neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu. Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Kpwa sababu mwafwahirwa, wakati phatu phangu phatakatifu phariphotiywa najisi, wakati tsi ya Iziraeli iriphorichwa wekee bila atu na atu a Juda ariphohalwa mateka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi ndakutiyani mikononi mwa atu a kula mlairo wa dzuwa yo tsi yenu indakala yao. Andapiga kambi na kuchita mahema kahi yenu, andarya mavuno genu na kunwa maziya genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindauhenda mudzi wa Raba ukale weru wa kurisa ngamia na tsi yosi ya Amoni ikale vyaa vya mangʼondzi na mbuzi. Ndipho mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Kpwa sababu mwapiga makofi na mchipiga mawala kpwa kuhererwa na kpwa mioyo yenu mii chinyume cha Iziraeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi lolani, nindaagolosera mkpwono wangu chinyume chenu, nami ndakulavyani dza zewe kpwa mataifa. Nami ndakuusani kahi ya mataifa, yani nindakuangamizani tsetsetse msikale na tsi yenu tsona. Nindakubanangani, ndipho mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
